# Group 1 smoke test: chat commands, a frame wait, and quit.
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   build/MineGame.exe --script scripts/smoke.mgs --script-timeout 60
#
# Results land in automation_out/run.log. Exit code 0 means the script ran to
# its end; 2 means a statement failed, 3 means the timeout elapsed first.

/noclip 1
/tp 0 80 0

wait frames 60

/pos
/seed

quit
